      <trans-unit id="help.compare_projected_end.under">
        <source>help.compare_projected_end.under</source>
        <target>The estimate went down: you should drive fewer kilometres by the end of the lease.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="help.compare_projected_end.reference">
        <source>help.compare_projected_end.reference</source>
        <target>Every day at midnight, Polaris estimates the total number of kilometres you will have driven by the end of your lease and records that estimate.

If no estimate is available for the first day of a period, the row says “Not enough history”.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="help.compare_projected_end.percent">
        <source>help.compare_projected_end.percent</source>
        <target>The percentage shows how the estimate changed compared with its value at the start of the period.</target>
      </trans-unit>
